<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n69785" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναυά̄γ-ιον</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναυήγιον</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>piece of
			wreckage</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				536.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				932a1
			</span></i>: mostly in pl., <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				420
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.191
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				8.12
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				2.38
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.50
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλοὺς ἀριθμοὺς ἄγνυται
				ναυαγίων</span>, i. e. is shivered into a thousand pieces,
				<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hel.</u>
				410
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν. ἱππικά</span>
			<i>wreck</i> of an overturned chariot, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				730
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1444
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνδρῶν δαιτυμόνων ν.</span> the
				<i>wreck</i> of a feast, <i><span class="en">
				Choeril.
				9
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ν. τῆς πόλεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Demad.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.803a
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν. οἴκων</span> ib. <i><span class="en">
				517f
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> later, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναυαγία, ναυαγίῳ
				περιπεσεῖν</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				Str.
				4.1.7
			</span></i>.</div>
